d a special reward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PILFERING</strong>- Steal from NPCs to increase your bounty. Available after level 2.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE SANCTUM </strong>- Upgrade your ancestral family home called Sanctum. Available after level 3.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821720/extras/58c5889383a0ab2623b38530d2e2f68f.poster.avif?t=1754831451\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821720/extras/58c5889383a0ab2623b38530d2e2f68f.webm?t=1754831451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821720/extras/58c5889383a0ab2623b38530d2e2f68f.mp4?t=1754831451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEND SANCTUM</strong> - From time to time hideously powerful bosses might attack your home ... you won't let them win will you?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FISHING</strong> - Spend a few quality moments catching fish in the streams, rivers and oceans of the Ridge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821720/extras/d357e79e9d7670856a0675f2a787d7be.poster.avif?t=1754831451\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821720/extras/d357e79e9d7670856a0675f2a787d7be.webm?t=1754831451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821720/extras/d357e79e9d7670856a0675f2a787d7be.mp4?t=1754831451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\